le swimming or climbing? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, you\u2019ll need to develop your explorer skills to unlock every corner of this vast and breathtaking forest. With an extensive skill tree to upgrade, you'll have the potential to become a master at your job and uncover the forest's hidden treasures. Utilize your upgraded skills to overcome challenges along the way, and pave the way for sustainable forestry practices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418380/extras/250d3cd754a56c75fcea4d8847f0fa83.poster.avif?t=1738603963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418380/extras/250d3cd754a56c75fcea4d8847f0fa83.webm?t=1738603963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1418380/extras/250d3cd754a56c75fcea4d8847f0fa83.mp4?t=1738603963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong> support for PlayStation DualSense/DualShock 4, Xbox Controller</strong>, a wide range of other gamepads and fully customizable bindings for mouse and keyboard, adjust your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique interface design and a wide range of usability options (eg. colorblindness, subtitles configuration) improves the overall experience for every willing forester. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced graphics settings allow to optimize the game performance best suited for your specific needs. Moreover, Forester Simulator will be optimized specifically for <strong>Steam Deck</strong>, offering a special graphics mode for Valve's handheld device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\